    "title": "VIDEO: Mariah Carey Waits In Line At Disneyland - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By UInterview ,\n5 hours ago Mariah Carey was spotted patiently waiting in line at Disneyland Resort in Anaheim, California. Footage posted to TikTok shows the Fantasy singer, wearing blue denim jeans and a white top, chewing gum as she stands in line at the theme park. Other images of Carey at Disneyland show her wearing the same outfit and Minnie Mouse ears. In February, Carey was trashed on social media for her poor lip-syncing performance at the Winter Olympics Opening ceremony .\nSource: uInterview",
